          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nywolirok pa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndir no, Kayisar Agusto owodho cik ma ndiko ji ŋey wokwan ji ma piny pere gipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me oyido obedo ndiko ji marapena, aka obedo i ndir pa Kwirino jadhum ma Siria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhano je okidho i tindi ma thugin ndikirok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno Yozefu bende oay i tindi ma Nazareth, i Galili to kidho Yuda i tindi pa Daudi m'ilwoŋo ni Bethelehem, paka go oyido obedo ja ot pa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yozefu okidho ni wondiki go gi Maria m'onwaŋo yiko nywomirok gine. Maria oyido yac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jonitie kenyo, hongo pa Maria otundo ma nywol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go onywolo wode makayo to umo gi nangin pa nyithindho, to pielo i wer ma dhok cem'iye rupiri kabedo k'onwaŋere rigo i ot wendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jokwath kodi Jomalaika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cegin kenyo onwaŋo nitie jokwath moro m'oyido jo ni sa jokuro mwendi pajo wor gi weso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika pa Rwoth omenyere rijo, aka dwoŋ pa Were omenyo jo, to jobwok swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika owaco rijo ni, “Wikiri wibedi gi lworo; kole akelo riwin wac kwoŋ kisangala madwoŋ ma bino bedo ri ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konon i tindi pa Daudi onywol riwin Jaboth, m'obedo Kristo Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka me a ranyuth riwin, wibino nwaŋo nyathi maŋic m'oboy i nangin pa nyithindho t'ipielo i wer ma cemo dhok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo ma piyo piyo, kweth jomalaika ma polo joriwere gi malaika no to jofoyo Were munyo jowero ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jomalaika jotieko weyo jo jogik i polo, jokwath jowaco wegi kendi gin ni, “Weyi wakidhi Bethelehem wanen gim'otimere ma Rwoth onyutho wan me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo joredo to jonwaŋo Maria gi Yozefu kodi nyathi m'opiel i wer ma cemo dhok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo joneno nyathi no, jowaco ri ji gima malaika owaco rijo kwoŋ nyathi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jom'owinjo wac me jouro swa gima jokwath no jowaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maria opoyo gigipiny me je to paro kwoŋe swa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokwath jodok munyo jofoyo Rwoth to jopako Were ro gigipiny je ma jowinjo aka joneno ni obedo paka owaci rijo won.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Icwoko nyingi Nyathi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 1:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ndelo mar'aboro ma thumo Nyathi otundo, ocwoki nyinge ni Yesu, nyinge ma malaika omiyo go mafodi k'ogam go i iy min.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Itero Yesu i Ot pa Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo ndelo otundo ri Yozefu kodi Maria ma tero cowirok ma lonyirok paka Cik pa Musa waco, jotero Nyathi no i Yerusalem ketho go i cingi Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " (Me a gim'ondiki i cik pa Rwoth ni, “Nyathi ma jacwo je m'obedo okayo pa min, ibino miyo Rwoth.”) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.12.6+LEV.12.7+LEV.12.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 12:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jotero kiri mic bende paka ondiki i cik pa Rwoth: Akurin ario kosa nyithindhi njiwa ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I Yerusalem kenyo onwaŋo nitie jal moro ma nyinge Simeo. Go oyido obedo dhano maber m'olworo Were, aka onwaŋo kiyo neno both pa Isiraili, kendo Cuny Maleŋ onwaŋo nigi go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuny Maleŋ onwaŋo otieko nyutho go ni go kilatho mafodi waŋe k'oneno Kristo pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Cuny Maleŋ owaco rigo, Simeo oay to kidho i Ot pa Were. Aka munyo jonywol jokelo Nyathi Yesu timo rigo gima Cik waco, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simeo otiŋo Nyathi no i cinge to foyo Were ka waco ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.2.28",
